First of all, sorry it took so long for me to get this written.  I had 
some issues with a gentoo install on my ancient firewall.

But anyways the patch is completed.  It adds an additional logfile, the 
tournament logfile, that includes the conduct information encoded in a 
variable length string.  The tournament logfile has the same format as 
the original logfile, except that it includes an additional 
variable-length string before the death string that contains all of the 
conduct info encoded as strings, like this:

3.4.3 7526 0 1 1 11 13 0 20041008 20041008 505 Pri Elf Mal Cha wizard 
^vegan polyless polyselfless atheist^, escaped

If there are no conducts then the carets will still appear, but with 
nothing between them.

Thanks to Andreas Dorn for providing the original patch which was the 
basis for my changes.

Finally, just in case my newsreader butchers the patch you can download 
it from: http://www.losgibsons.us/john/nethack.html

John

